  "id": "dbt",
  "term": "DBT",
  "definition": "DBT, here referring to Dialectical Behavioural Therapy for Adolescents (DBT-A), is a psychotherapy used for adolescents who show features of borderline personality disorder. It is described as an effective treatment, with outcomes influenced by changeable factors such as the therapeutic relationship, emotional interactions, and motivation.",
